  "description": "Chemical vapor deposition of thin films (SiO₂, Si₃N₄, polysilicon, tungsten) from gas-phase precursors using APCVD (350-500°C), LPCVD (550-900°C), or PECVD (200-400°C). Gas-phase reactants decompose or react at the substrate surface, depositing conformal films for gate electrodes, interlayer dielectrics, passivation, and contact fills.",
